Glitch Cafe is a tech-themed virtual café designed to offer users a playful, interactive, and immersive online experience. It blends technology and design by simulating a digital café environment where users can browse glitch-inspired menu items, interact with an AI-powered chatbot assistant, and simulate ordering in a fun and engaging way.

Built for creativity and innovation, Glitch Cafe showcases modern web development tools, AI integration, and responsive design — all wrapped in a unique aesthetic that celebrates tech culture.
